  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Nobody touched it."
 },
 {
  "id": "l03",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Here's the problem. A normal Kubernetes rollout sends every single user to the new version within minutes."
 },
 {
  "id": "l04",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "If that version is broken, everyone gets the bug."
 },
 {
  "id": "l05",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "So I built a release that tests itself on real traffic."
 },
 {
  "id": "l06",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "The new version gets one pod in five. Twenty percent."
 },
 {
  "id": "l07",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Every fifteen seconds, Prometheus checks its errors and its latency against an S-L-O."
 },
 {
  "id": "l08",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Now watch. Version one point two fails a quarter of its requests."
 },
 {
  "id": "l09",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Error ratio: zero point three. The limit: zero point zero seven."
 },
 {
  "id": "l10",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Two strikes. Rollout aborted. Every user back on the good version."
 },
 {
  "id": "l11",
  "voice": "Steve",
  "settings": {
   "model": "mtl_tts",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "seed": 3000
  },
  "tts": "Forty-two seconds. Zero humans."
